{
 "note": "Aerial coastline, waterfalls, ridgelines, forest and open water. One palette -- teal, green, dusk -- and no people, no interiors, no signage. 36 clips so the edit is not forced to repeat itself.",
 "made_by": {
  "how": "curated",
  "who": "a person looking at a contact sheet of 75 landscape clips",
  "not": "NOT selected by the system; this is the third set curated by eye. The measurements separate bright from dark and still from moving, and none of that distinguishes a coastline from a car park.",
  "why_this_world": "The previous set was a nightclub and read as NSFW. This one carries no such risk and suits a big EDM build."
 },
